<h3>Why Experimental Stem Cell Therapy Is Not an Established Cure</h3>
<p>Critical Medical Warning: There is currently no medical cure for Huntington&#x27;s Disease. Stem Cell Therapy for Huntington&#x27;s Disease in Japan remains investigational and experimental. Cell procedures should never be represented as a guaranteed cure or a substitute for proven neurological care.</p>
