<h3>Building an Informed Long-Term Care Plan for Huntington&#x27;s Disease</h3>
<p>Regardless of whether a family investigates experimental research abroad, establishing a comprehensive long-term care plan at home in Malaysia remains essential. An optimal care plan integrates the following five key areas:</p>
